  cell                    metric          base            candF          delta
  photo_cid 512² p6       instructions    1,537,468,173   1,500,453,523  -2.41 %
                          cycles            444,423,814     431,287,427  **-2.96 %**
                          branches          249,465,012     241,307,799  -3.27 %
